WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.386
Sovereign E-Petitions, Phase 4.

00:00:02.386 --> 00:00:08.000
Five legally formatted grievance instruments requiring House of Commons sponsorship under the Standing Orders.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.636
Each petition targets a specific structural mechanism identified by TENET5 investigations.

00:00:13.636 --> 00:00:21.227
They must be sponsored by a sitting Member of Parliament and require 500 signatures in 120 days to compel a government response.

00:00:21.227 --> 00:00:24.534
Petition 1: The Sovereign Repatriation Mandate.

00:00:24.534 --> 00:00:39.159
Calls for the immediate repatriation of 2,000 Canadian Armed Forces personnel deployed to Latvia under Operation REASSURANCE, arguing their absence leaves Canadians structurally unprotected while the executive builds a 300,000-man domestic strategic reserve.

00:00:39.159 --> 00:00:41.863
Petition 2: The Democide Halt.

00:00:41.863 --> 00:00:57.511
Calls for the immediate suspension of MAID expansion and forceful detachment of the medical framework from executive override, identifying the expanding Medical Assistance in Dying protocol as a calculated vector of covert democide through administrative bureaucracy rather than kinetic violence.

00:00:57.511 --> 00:01:00.988
Petition 3: Universal Judicial Venue Declaration.

00:01:00.988 --> 00:01:15.704
Calls upon the House of Commons to declare that any citizen may lay a private prosecution under Section 504 of the Criminal Code in any provincial court for offences spanning the entire federal domain, preventing jurisdictional bottlenecks from being weaponized to suppress charges.

00:01:15.704 --> 00:01:18.772
Petition 4: The Extractive Starvation Audit.

00:01:18.772 --> 00:01:32.272
Demands an independent financial audit of 613 billion dollars in undocumented or mismanaged procurement capital over the last decade, treating the continuous capital lapse as calculated domestic hostility rather than accounting error.

00:01:32.272 --> 00:01:36.227
Petition 5: Anti-Chemical Suppression and Architect Protection.

00:01:36.227 --> 00:01:47.897
Calls for an investigation into the weaponization of psychiatric hold orders by court proxies, documenting 6 years of attempts to use forced chemical lobotomization on citizens mapping institutional corruption.
